OL,3,GNEWSA'NHS drug funding could help us
OL,4,Alive longer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor Charlotte Casey, one of the things
OL,7,Fshe struggles most with is "not being
OL,8,Fable to do the most mundane of things
OL,9,Fwith my little girls, like dancing
OL,10,Faround in the kitchen.
OL,12,F"Or picking them up when they fall
OL,13,Fover... your natural instinct is to
OL,14,Fgrab your child when they've hurt
OL,15,Fthemselves and we can't do that."
OL,17,FCharlotte, 25, and her sister Olivia
OL,18,FDews, 28, from Worcestershire, were
OL,19,Fdiagnosed with the progressive
OL,20,Fneurodegenerative disease, Freidriech's
OL,21,FAtaxia (FA), in 2024 and now need to
OL,22,Fuse wheelchairs.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
