OL,3,GNEWSA'NHS drug funding could help us
OL,4,Alive longer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe illness damages the spinal cord,
OL,7,Fperipheral nerves and the cerebellum in
OL,8,Fthe brain, with an average life
OL,9,Fexpectancy for those affected of 35-50
OL,10,Fyears.
